ot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tzaIhqjTSj8Q7kNvwG-WL4F&_nc_oc=AdryrLR2sHXqLbaqMCGUb_PE3GrwapldMpvXuVFHv8B75CWyRImug2ZuApYmxkLcRFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1rti-q3YiRe2Me5_y_Y5VRhk1Q27SyxT3zXrn6x81QOg&oe=69F1F957"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w0ty7rKRLH4Q7kNvwFcDxlX&_nc_oc=AdoXUYe2ELZ6r0S1H41dsb5K3nn-xQGgzNZKFarSQg2ncQl6oTuKPpUKAC1qo2_z0VM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3FaGzNKuyJpg6fplz3uL8zzhjYnPaRgmPLNbcF-g69Iw&oe=69F1FE95"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qcGtOqcLDO0Q7kNvwFglH96&_nc_oc=Adrti3uOMva77a1h3XeKImZwwi7wWjVukLLvc2m7hDa-vs5XWvHNQ79xvZoQbQF8_Zw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0T0Mb4sJRMr6wa21-pGIXDhqa4GyLJ3RFTAIa-BJPf7Q&oe=69F21242"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kRAzR1W2G_gQ7kNvwGlS_Ex&_nc_oc=AdqKoeL3JGtI6VQjclyHe0_ypBj3oxTxF9FjchOlILqqOUQamzlraGKD2D2duwMQ7ec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3_ZKuG0D9iMAFs-W82wqAm4tjXoqg0pVrifs7FRGQZZQ&oe=69F1F8C4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8pq5V8-u3cQ7kNvwFouTpv&_nc_oc=AdqabgBCZudgvSTcCA3_H8p-P1Y1ZpG2-jUr6s-wsMpokCkd-cR0CFWIWjz3xs6X92I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3Es5ySRx_Q_-YFIGyVv0LyRL9Msk7Qng2L0wOGhurlEg&oe=69F1F122"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "874968081049627", "image_type": "AP